    "body": "Given all implementations somehow dealt with null without filing a spec issue, I think we probably need to just modify the spec 😕\n\n* https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/0fc599421fc27ac61c501f277cb440777f85b18a/dom/fs/api/FileSystemWritableFileStream.cpp#614-616\n* https://searchfox.org/wubkat/rev/2288ce31211e8b9fa825e5af8cb1afd1aa58cb6e/Source/WebCore/Modules/filesystem/FileSystemWritableFileStreamSink.cpp#73-74\n* https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/file_system_access/file_system_underlying_sink.cc;l=126-137;drc=14124cfccffd291611a9062ec583940c27895941",
